## SQ-WGE-06d | same layouts across restarts; no invalid element on save
# PoolElementStructurePiece minecraft:empty at save is a known third-party line (gotchas): excluded below
> save-all flush
waitlog Saved the game 300
reject (?i)Element (?!minecraft:empty).* is not valid
# the fresh-area layout half is checked across worlds of the same seed: w_3_B.qb SQ-WGE-06d-x (layouts, W1 vs W2)
